{%- comment -%}
  Outputs a variant's availability for Kashkoul Market: in_stock, on_order or sold_out (agreed rule, step 4):
    quantity above 0                                → in_stock
    quantity 0, "continue selling when out of stock" → on_order   (ordered from the US for the customer)
    quantity 0, not continuing                       → sold_out
  A variant whose stock isn't tracked counts as in_stock (Shopify treats it as always available).
  No variant (the picked options don't make a real variant) → none.
  Accepts: variant
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  if variant == blank
    echo 'none'
  elsif variant.available == false
    echo 'sold_out'
  elsif variant.inventory_management == blank
    echo 'in_stock'
  elsif variant.inventory_quantity > 0
    echo 'in_stock'
  else
    echo 'on_order'
  endif
-%}
